  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "关于论文《CAp 2017 challenge: Twitter Named Entity Recognition》，What questions were asked in the annotation process?",
      "turn_id": "d10-t1"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": {
        "claims": [
          {
            "key": "entity_identification_then_typing",
            "text": "在标注过程中，首先需要识别数据集中出现的实体，然后用13种可能的类型之一对其进行标注。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1707.07568",
                "chunk_id": "c-78f3bd1d48efb38bcc8ce848"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "type_descriptions_available",
            "text": "论文为每种实体类型提供了描述，并将这些描述同时提供给标注者和挑战赛参与者。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1707.07568",
                "chunk_id": "c-78f3bd1d48efb38bcc8ce848"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "hashtag_mention_protocol",
            "text": "由于@提及用于指称人物、#话题标签用于标示关键词，标注过程对它们采用了专门的处理协议：只有当两个条件都满足时，话题标签或提及才应被标注为实体。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1707.07568",
                "chunk_id": "c-78f3bd1d48efb38bcc8ce848"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "thirteen_entity_types",
            "text": "挑战赛要求识别13种实体类型：person、musicartist、organisation、geoloc、product、transportLine、media、sportsteam、event、tvshow、movie、facility、other。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1707.07568",
                "chunk_id": "c-2da092855580ca68f6de58a1"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "no_hierarchical_entities",
            "text": "实体不允许层级化，即连续词作为一个整体属于一个实体，每个词只关联一种实体类型。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1707.07568",
                "chunk_id": "c-2da092855580ca68f6de58a1"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "inter_annotator_agreement",
            "text": "标注者间一致性基于Cohen's Kappa在训练集前200条推文上计算，得分为0.70，被认为表示强一致性。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1707.07568",
                "chunk_id": "c-78f3bd1d48efb38bcc8ce848"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "decision": "answer"
      },
      "turn_id": "d10-t1"
    },
